771	// ─── Auto-Fix Sandbox Tools (mode 'autofix-sandbox' only) ────────────
772	//
773	// Every fix_* tool below wraps a HARDCODED command string (or a hardcoded
774	// JS-native action). The agent only chooses *which* tool to call —
775	// command content is never built from agent input. The single exception
776	// is fix_kill_process_by_name's `name` argument, which is validated
777	// against KILLABLE_PROCESS_ALLOWLIST before being interpolated.
778	//
779	// These tools are registered ONLY when createPcPalMcpServer is called
780	// with { mode: 'autofix-sandbox' }. Normal-mode chat literally cannot
781	// invoke them — they're not in the tool list.
